1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,980
You can do most things in ActTrader from the keyboard.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:08,540
Press Shift+F1 at any time to see every shortcut.

3
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:12,910
General shortcuts work anywhere in the app.

4
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:18,360
These work when the watchlist or Instruments tab is selected.

5
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:21,860
Scroll down for positions, orders and more.

6
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,830
Press Escape to close the list.

7
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:31,960
Ctrl+Shift+Tab moves to the next tab along the top.

8
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:34,570
In the watchlist, the arrow keys move up and down.

9
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:38,370
Alt+N opens the chart for the instrument you picked.

10
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:43,520
Alt+F jumps straight to the search box.

